     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "How do you edit an issue?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Apologies: bad wording at the start of use case 1.  Much better would have been \"Hydra will define a common metadata content model for all objects.\"  Similarly in 2, \"Hydra will define a 'simple image' content model for objects which deliver the same image at a variety of resolutions.\"  Taking sloppy shortcuts with my language...",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
