     "body": "<p>How do you edit an issue?</p>\n\n<p>Apologies: bad wording at the start of use case 1.  Much better would have been \"Hydra will define a common metadata content model for all objects.\"  Similarly in 2, \"Hydra will define a 'simple image' content model for objects which deliver the same image at a variety of resolutions.\"  Taking sloppy shortcuts with my language...</p>",
     "created": "18/Sep/09 7:27 AM",
     "id": "11010",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10511/comment/11010",
